cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper below."
title: "C3-JEPA — minimal reference implementation"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Aim404/c3-jepa"
abstract: >-
  Minimal, self-contained implementation of Underwater C3-JEPA an object-centric,
  cross-view, control-conditioned predictive world model for ROV salvage: slot-attention
  tokenizer, held-out-view cross-view fusion, weak binding, SIGReg and a
  control-conditioned predictor, in a single trainable and testable script.
